00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:29.700
{=0}Miki- chan 
has a question
 for Oniisan

00:06:30.040 --> 00:06:31.540
I wonder what it is.

00:06:33.250 --> 00:06:35.670
Miki-<i>chan</i>. What's your question?

00:06:35.670 --> 00:06:38.000
How old are you, Oniisan?

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:40.000
I'm 31.

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:44.880
Um... My dad is 29 years old.

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:49.760
How come you aren't married
and don't have any kids?

00:06:51.810 --> 00:06:54.520
Give me a break.

00:06:54.520 --> 00:06:56.850
Listen, kids.

00:06:56.850 --> 00:06:59.650
Everyone's life is different.

00:06:59.650 --> 00:07:02.530
Just because a single guy
guzzles down cheap saké

00:07:02.530 --> 00:07:05.280
while watching boring
late-night dramas every night,

00:07:05.280 --> 00:07:08.620
you shouldn't assume that he's unhappy.

00:07:08.620 --> 00:07:11.990
Careless thoughts can
sometimes kill people.

00:07:11.990 --> 00:07:15.290
What are you talking about?

00:07:15.290 --> 00:07:16.790
I don't know.

00:07:19.880 --> 00:07:22.300
I don't know anything anymore!

00:07:25.590 --> 00:07:29.010
You're Tomoki-<i>kun</i>, right? Did you fall?

00:07:29.010 --> 00:07:30.720
That hurts, huh?

00:07:30.720 --> 00:07:33.430
Okay. Just watch me.

00:07:34.680 --> 00:07:39.650
Where's the meaning
of my existence...? Peek-a...

00:07:39.650 --> 00:07:40.940
...boo.

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:45.280
When you become an adult,
you have to stop crying on your own

00:07:45.280 --> 00:07:49.030
because no one will play
peek-a-boo with you.

00:07:51.490 --> 00:07:53.160
"Call Usao and Kumao"

00:07:53.740 --> 00:07:58.670
All right, then! Let's call out to
our friends, Usao-<i>kun </i>and Kumao-<i>kun</i>!

00:07:58.670 --> 00:08:00.250
One, two...

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:02.250
Usao-<i>kun</i>!

00:08:02.250 --> 00:08:04.380
Kumao-<i>kun</i>!

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:06.460
Silence...

00:08:07.840 --> 00:08:11.970
Oh? It seems like we weren't loud enough.

00:08:11.970 --> 00:08:14.390
Let's try it again, louder this time!

00:08:14.390 --> 00:08:15.850
One, two...

00:08:15.850 --> 00:08:17.850
Usao-<i>kun</i>!

00:08:17.850 --> 00:08:20.020
Kumao-<i>kun</i>!

00:08:20.850 --> 00:08:22.230
Silence

00:08:23.940 --> 00:08:29.280
Oh? It seems that it
still wasn't loud enough.

00:08:29.280 --> 00:08:31.320
Let's call them one more time!

00:08:31.320 --> 00:08:33.330
One, two...

00:08:33.330 --> 00:08:35.290
Usa--

00:08:35.290 --> 00:08:37.200
Are you okay, Oniisan?

00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:38.750
Is it ‘cause of your hard drinking?

